      </infoLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Pater Consularis" id="2b11-c009-4479-8db0" page="11" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599">
          <description>A Legion Castra Ferrum Centurion must select a single Pater Consularis upgrade; no model may take more than one such upgrade. The various Pater Consularis types are listed here, but full rules for them can be found in the Pater Consularis section later in this document:
●    Pater Consularis Librarian .................................. +50 points ●    Pater Consularis Master of Signals .................... +40 points ●    Pater Consularis Forge Lord ............................... +50 points ●    Pater Consularis Siege Breaker ........................... +55 points ●    Pater Consularis Chaplain................................... +50 points ●    Pater Consularis Armistos................................... +30 points ●    Pater Consularis Herald....................................... +40 points</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
